  "_comment": "Default runtime catalog bundled with the app. Android-built OpenJDK 17/21/25 from the ZalithLauncher project (Pojav-family builds, GPLv2 + Classpath Exception), each split into a universal part and a per-CPU part that are extracted into one directory. URLs are pinned to commit ed8a5c873b25f19d08aef5bdfc1084fd9aff836c and every part is verified by SHA-256. Java 8 is intentionally absent: its jars are Pack200-compressed and need a native unpack200 helper this app does not include yet. Format: {name, java, abi, parts:[{url, sha256, size}], sizeMb}; a single {url, sha256} is also accepted.",
